{"sha": "c7f0a3a36c260fa0443d5d49957bfe56e59ac300507c408635096e3613ba1326", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b2:laser} 章 --- 激光：受激辐射与高斯光束}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:laser:1}", "$\\nu = \\qty{4.74e14}{Hz}$; $h\\nu = \\qty{3.14e-19}{J} = \\qty{1.96}{eV}$;", "每秒 $\\qty{3.2e15}{}$ 个光子；$c/2L = \\qty{500}{MHz}$；三", "个模式。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:laser:2}", "$\\eu^{-80} \\approx 2 \\times 10^{-35}$；仅当 $T \\to \\infty$ 时等号成立；", "$N_2 > N_1$ 要求 $\\eu^{-h\\nu/k_BT} > 1$，即形式上 $T < 0$。", "当 \\qty{24}{GHz} 时，$h\\nu = \\qty{1e-4}{eV}$：$N_2/N_1 = 0.996$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:laser:3}", "$z_{\\text{R}} = \\qty{1.24}{m}$; $\\theta = \\qty{4.0e-4}{rad}$; $w(\\qty{100}{m}) =", "\\qty{40}{mm}$；在月球处为 \\qty{150}{km}。经 $\\times 20$ 后：$w_0 = \\qty{10}{mm}$，", "$\\theta = \\qty{2e-5}{rad}$，$z_{\\text{R}} = \\qty{500}{m}$，在", "\\qty{100}{m} 处为 \\qty{10.2}{mm}，在月球处为 \\qty{7.7}{km}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:laser:4}", "$g_{\\text{th}} = (0.005 + 0.0101)/0.2 = \\qty{0.076}{m^{-1}} < 0.2$：激光器起振。", "取 $R_2 = 0.90$ 时：$(0.005 + 0.053)/0.2 = \\qty{0.29}{m^{-1}}$：", "不起振。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:laser:5}", "(a) 见\\cref{prop:b2:laser:einstein}。(b) \\qty{600}{nm}：$h\\nu/k_BT", "= 80$，比值 $5 \\times 10^{34}$；\\qty{1}{cm}：$4.8 \\times 10^{-3}$ ---", "受激辐射占主导。(c) 在微波频段", "自发辐射可以忽略，少量粒子数反转即可", "获得增益；所需技术（谐振腔、波导）早已存在。(d) $A \\propto", "\\nu^3$，因此 $\\tau \\propto \\lambda^3$：\\qty{10}{\\micro s}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:laser:6}", "(a) $I_{\\text{s}} = h\\nu/\\sigma\\tau = \\qty{1.0e5}{W/m^2}$. (b) $R =", "g_0/\\sigma\\tau = \\qty{3.3e22}{m^{-3}.s^{-1}}$. (c) $I = I_{\\text{s}}(5 - 1) =", "\\qty{4.2e5}{W/m^2}$; $P_{\\text{out}} = 0.01 \\times 4.2 \\times 10^5 \\times", "10^{-6} = \\qty{4.2}{mW}$. (d) $I = I_{\\text{s}}(\\sigma R\\tau/g_{\\text{th}}", "- 1) = (h\\nu/g_{\\text{th}})(R - g_{\\text{th}}/\\sigma\\tau)$：关于 $R$ 呈线性", "在 $R_{\\text{th}} = g_{\\text{th}}/\\sigma\\tau$ 以上。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:laser:7}", "(a) $c/2L > \\qty{1.5}{GHz}$: $L < \\qty{10}{cm}$. (b) $\\delta\\nu = \\nu\\,\\delta L/L", "= \\qty{1.6}{GHz}$：三个纵模间隔，即整个增益宽度 --- 该模式", "扫过增益曲线，并交接给相邻的纵模。(c) 用", "加热器将腔长控制在 $\\lambda$ 的很小一部分内，以", "两纵模的平衡作为误差信号。(d) $c/\\delta\\nu \\approx", "\\qty{100}{km}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:laser:8}", "(a) $w_0' = \\qty{10}{\\micro m}$, $z_{\\text{R}} = \\qty{0.5}{mm}$, $I = 2P/\\pi", "w_0'^2 = \\qty{6.4e6}{W/m^2}$. (b) $w_0' = \\qty{3.4}{\\micro m}$, $I =", "\\qty{5.5e7}{W/m^2}$；太阳的像：$10^3 \\times (3/0.15)^2 =", "\\qty{4e5}{W/m^2}$ --- 激光笔差一百倍。(c) 灯泡的", "功率分布于 $4\\pi$ 立体角内，其在视网膜上的像是扩展的；激光笔的", "全部功率集中在几微米之内，位于", "最敏感的波长处。(d) $2z_{\\text{R}} = \\qty{1}{mm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:laser:9}", "(a) $(N/2)\\,h\\nu/\\tau = \\qty{7.6e8}{W/m^3}$。(b) \\qty{760}{W} --- 连续", "运行不可行：应采用闪光灯。(c) $10^{22} \\times 1.87 \\times", "10^{-19}/2.3 \\times 10^{-4} = \\qty{8e6}{W/m^3}$：\\qty{8}{W} 每立方", "厘米。(d) 功率小一百倍，且为连续工作：", "几瓦的二极管光即可满足要求。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:laser:10}", "(a) $\\lambda/\\pi w_0$：\\qty{0.17}{rad}（\\qty{9.5}{\\degree}）和 \\qty{0.5}{rad}", "（\\qty{28}{\\degree}）。(b) 窄方向的发散更大：", "远场椭圆与发射体垂直。(c) $f\\theta$：", "\\qty{0.8}{mm} 和 \\qty{2.5}{mm}。(d) 一对变形棱镜或", "柱面透镜；或耦合进单模光纤。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:laser:11}", "(a) 强度每 \\qty{2}{ns} 增至 $\\times 1.04$ 倍。(b) $N = P\\,(2L/c)/h\\nu =", "6.4 \\times 10^8$ 个光子；$\\ln(6.4 \\times 10^8)/\\ln 1.04 \\approx 520$ 次", "往返，约 \\qty{1}{\\micro s}。(c) 增益饱和；低于", "阈值的模式每次往返损耗大于增益，并停留在", "自发辐射水平。(d) 各模式共享同一粒子数反转；最强的", "模式使其饱和，使其余模式无增益可用；腔长与增益的漂移", "会改变胜出的模式 --- 输出在各模式间跳变。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:laser:12}", "(a) $2.7 \\times 10^{17}$ 个光子；\\qty{1}{GW}。(b) $\\theta = \\qty{3.4e-7}{rad}$，", "\\qty{130}{m}；视宁度为 \\qty{1.8}{km}。(c) 分数为 $0.1/\\pi(1800)^2 =", "10^{-8}$：$2.6 \\times 10^9$ 个光子；返回光的扩散 \\qty{1.3e-5}{rad}，半径", "为 \\qty{5}{km}；望远镜接收到 $(0.5/5000)^2 = 10^{-8}$：约 $25$", "个光子，经光学元件后仅剩几个。(d) $c \\times \\qty{100}{ps}/2 = \\qty{1.5}{cm}$；", "$\\times 1/\\sqrt{10^4}$: \\qty{0.15}{mm}.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:laser:1}", "\\textbf{1.} \\qty{1.96}{eV}, \\qty{4.74e14}{Hz}.", "", "\\textbf{2.} $\\qty{0.05}{eV} \\approx 1.5\\,k_BT$：热运动提供", "微小的亏缺；转移几乎共振，因此效率高。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $\\eu^{-20.66/0.0345} = \\eu^{-600} \\approx 10^{-260}$：无；只有", "放电向该能级提供粒子。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 下能级的排空速度比上能级的", "衰变快十倍：它始终几乎为空 --- 即四能级方案。", ""]}